WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.211 --> 00:00:03.754
I have spent my life...

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:05.714
trying to protect my family.

00:00:05.923 --> 00:00:07.925
♪♪

00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:10.427
The children...

00:00:10.594 --> 00:00:11.595
they have the
ability...

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.554
to see.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.514
Now, they will
come for us.

00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:19.937
We're now at war.

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:22.022
The first nation
to harness sight.

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:23.440
will dominate
the world.

00:00:23.774 --> 00:00:25.776
♪♪

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.028
This new weapon...

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:30.656
more powerful
than you can imagine.

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:32.908
All of Paya 
will be ours.

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:34.076
Bomb them.

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:37.412
♪♪

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:40.040
♪♪

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.166
You are my husband.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:43.043
And their father.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.504
You must decide
what is best for us.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.798
I will die before I allow

00:00:47.798 --> 00:00:49.091
anything happen to you.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:52.302
♪♪

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:56.556
♪♪

